WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 11]

01:49.180 --> 01:49.540
[Wangcheng]

01:49.540 --> 01:52.660
Hooray!

01:52.820 --> 02:00.300
- Your Highness! - Your Highness!

02:00.820 --> 02:01.380
Your Highness,

02:01.940 --> 02:03.020
we've prepared wine.

02:03.540 --> 02:04.140
Do me the honor.

02:04.340 --> 02:05.580
Have some victory wine

02:05.580 --> 02:06.140
before you go.

02:06.940 --> 02:08.220
I appreciate it, General.

02:08.500 --> 02:09.820
But we must hurry to Yunzhong.

02:09.940 --> 02:10.500
No delays.

02:11.140 --> 02:11.660
Your Highness.

02:13.140 --> 02:14.140
She longs to go home.

02:14.140 --> 02:15.260
Don't stand in her way.

02:15.700 --> 02:16.620
Everybody,

02:20.060 --> 02:20.980
thank you

02:21.340 --> 02:22.180
for all this.

02:22.380 --> 02:22.940
Your Highness,

02:23.020 --> 02:24.260
take this for the journey.

02:24.260 --> 02:24.980
Folks,

02:25.500 --> 02:26.460
the army will move out.

02:26.660 --> 02:28.820
Don't stand in their way or delay them.

02:29.140 --> 02:30.140
We appreciate your good intentions.

03:19.620 --> 03:20.780
My Lord, Mr. Deng is here.

03:25.260 --> 03:25.940
Show him in.

03:26.460 --> 03:26.860
Yes.

03:34.300 --> 03:36.620
Mr. Xie, you're working at this late hour.

03:37.460 --> 03:39.420
You truly are a pillar of the court.

03:39.900 --> 03:41.140
You didn't visit me so late

03:41.980 --> 03:43.700
just to praise me, did you?

03:44.820 --> 03:46.580
I'm here to congratulate you.

03:47.620 --> 03:48.300
Mr. Xie,

03:49.340 --> 03:50.460
the battle of Wangcheng

03:51.620 --> 03:52.580
was a good one.

03:53.060 --> 03:54.380
What makes you say that?

03:55.380 --> 03:56.060
Her Highness

03:56.060 --> 03:57.700
commanded the victory.

03:58.300 --> 03:58.860
And of course,

04:00.100 --> 04:01.460
my brother fought valiantly.

04:02.140 --> 04:03.940
I dare not take any credit.

04:04.420 --> 04:06.380
Xie Yanlai escorted Her Highness

04:07.300 --> 04:09.740
and helped secure the victory of Wangcheng.

04:10.860 --> 04:12.660
So, he's likely to take over

04:13.460 --> 04:14.940
the frontier troops in Yunzhong.

04:16.340 --> 04:16.900
Mr. Xie,

04:18.380 --> 04:19.460
that was a clever plan.

04:22.900 --> 04:24.260
Have you lost your senses?

04:24.580 --> 04:25.940
His Majesty made Yanlai

04:26.500 --> 04:27.940
the Imperial Guard Commander.

04:28.940 --> 04:30.540
How could he leave the imperial city?

04:31.100 --> 04:31.900
Besides,

04:33.100 --> 04:35.020
it won't be easy to take over frontier troops.

04:35.300 --> 04:36.780
It might be hard for someone else.

04:37.500 --> 04:39.060
But for you,

04:40.140 --> 04:41.860
it's a piece of cake.

04:43.420 --> 04:44.580
After all, your brother

04:45.060 --> 04:46.940
deployed the bandits from Cangmu Stronghold

04:46.940 --> 04:47.740
to fight for him.

04:50.180 --> 04:50.900
I just wonder

04:50.900 --> 04:52.340
if he knows

04:53.500 --> 04:54.420
his connections

04:54.420 --> 04:55.700
with those bandits

04:56.100 --> 04:58.020
in the Wei Village.

04:59.100 --> 04:59.700
Mr. Deng,

05:00.180 --> 05:01.900
what's said

05:03.420 --> 05:05.100
can't be unsaid.

05:08.580 --> 05:09.220
Mr. Xie,

05:10.300 --> 05:11.540
don't be nervous.

05:12.540 --> 05:14.220
I'm just curious.

05:14.660 --> 05:16.460
Who actually set the fire

05:17.060 --> 05:18.700
in the Wei Village?

05:19.580 --> 05:21.180
And why does a man

05:21.940 --> 05:23.500
who cares for his younger brother

05:23.620 --> 05:24.780
refuse to see the truth?

05:25.300 --> 05:26.700
If you had proof,

05:27.380 --> 05:29.100
you could report it to His Majesty.

05:29.820 --> 05:31.580
Instead, you came to probe me so late.

05:32.420 --> 05:33.980
Let me give you some advice.

05:34.420 --> 05:35.940
You can't bring down my clan

05:36.180 --> 05:38.380
by using Xie Yanlai.

05:38.980 --> 05:40.860
There's a reason

05:41.380 --> 05:43.780
that my clan has endured for a century.

05:44.980 --> 05:47.420
I'm just talking about the facts.

05:52.140 --> 05:53.900
As for your century-old authority...

05:55.580 --> 05:56.980
Handled properly,

05:58.420 --> 06:00.860
even a big tree can be uprooted.

06:07.460 --> 06:08.540
How interesting.

06:10.580 --> 06:11.100
Mr. Deng,

06:11.700 --> 06:12.860
how about

06:14.220 --> 06:15.540
we make a bet?

06:22.940 --> 06:23.660
On what?

06:24.060 --> 06:25.420
Tomorrow,

06:27.100 --> 06:28.980
we'll both plead illness to avoid court.

06:29.460 --> 06:31.100
See what His Majesty will do?

06:31.220 --> 06:31.740
No.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.140
I want you to see

06:34.780 --> 06:35.940
who the ministers will support

06:37.740 --> 06:39.140
and how much

06:40.660 --> 06:42.180
my clan matters.

06:42.780 --> 06:43.420
All right.

06:46.300 --> 06:47.300
I'll take that bet.

07:04.460 --> 07:05.860
The Northern Desert envoy is here.

07:07.620 --> 07:08.380
You promised

07:09.580 --> 07:10.660
that you would send troops

07:10.660 --> 07:11.900
to help us invade Wangcheng.

07:12.580 --> 07:14.020
But instead of sending any troops,

07:14.140 --> 07:15.740
you watched our defeat

07:15.740 --> 07:16.580
and heavy losses.

07:17.180 --> 07:17.940
My remaining troops

07:18.460 --> 07:20.420
all died in Yunzhong!

07:21.780 --> 07:22.780
I wonder

07:23.660 --> 07:24.700
how you'll explain that.

07:25.380 --> 07:27.020
Battle conditions change rapidly.

07:28.580 --> 07:31.460
I did my best to let you pass through

07:32.140 --> 07:33.740
at great personal risk.

07:34.980 --> 07:36.500
How could I have foreseen everything?

07:37.740 --> 07:38.500
Besides,

07:39.300 --> 07:41.300
if your remaining troops

07:41.780 --> 07:42.980
died in my prefecture,

07:43.660 --> 07:45.900
the court would suspect and blame me.

07:47.020 --> 07:48.580
It wouldn't benefit me at all.

07:50.460 --> 07:51.580
If it makes you

07:52.260 --> 07:53.620
suspect my sincerity

07:53.660 --> 07:54.860
in allying with you,

07:58.140 --> 07:59.780
I'll be really disappointed.

08:04.580 --> 08:06.140
Do you think this excuse

08:07.260 --> 08:09.060
will justify my troops

08:09.580 --> 08:10.820
dying in vain?

08:19.780 --> 08:21.780
Has your king ever trusted me?

08:23.260 --> 08:23.820
After all,

08:24.500 --> 08:25.460
he still

08:25.460 --> 08:26.740
hasn't told me

08:27.900 --> 08:29.380
why he asked me to help your men

08:30.300 --> 08:31.540
set the fire in the Wei Village

08:32.020 --> 08:33.860
five years ago.

08:35.580 --> 08:37.820
If I hadn't sent men to clear it up,

08:38.740 --> 08:39.940
it wouldn't have been

08:39.940 --> 08:41.060
kept so perfectly secret.

08:42.100 --> 08:43.540
But now, you doubt me.

08:47.420 --> 08:49.140
Go back and tell your king.

08:50.060 --> 08:50.820
A plan succeeds

08:51.220 --> 08:52.780
through mutual trust.

08:53.900 --> 08:55.180
If he demands an answer

08:55.260 --> 08:56.060
on this matter,

08:58.660 --> 08:59.980
our alliance will end here.

09:54.540 --> 09:55.020
Jiu,

09:55.580 --> 09:56.340
had a nightmare?

10:01.140 --> 10:01.940
Just now,

10:02.780 --> 10:03.900
you looked in pain.

10:06.060 --> 10:06.620
Nothing.

10:09.620 --> 10:10.260
Just a dream.

10:17.060 --> 10:18.500
I'm going to see my father soon.

10:22.660 --> 10:23.980
Aren't you supposed to be happy?

10:26.220 --> 10:27.420
It's not that I'm not happy.

10:29.260 --> 10:30.100
I'm just scared.

10:32.620 --> 10:33.540
Of what?

10:35.220 --> 10:36.340
My father's illness.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.900
People get sick.

10:45.460 --> 10:46.140
Don't worry.

10:47.020 --> 10:47.660
Maybe

10:48.620 --> 10:49.460
by the time we arrive,

10:50.940 --> 10:52.180
your father will have recovered.

10:56.460 --> 10:58.060
I hope so.

12:25.780 --> 12:26.660
The General once said,

12:26.820 --> 12:28.180
when you came back someday,

12:28.380 --> 12:30.060
he would be waiting at the city gate.

12:34.940 --> 12:35.380
Yeah.

12:36.020 --> 12:37.980
You're the undefeated God of War.

12:38.340 --> 12:40.180
You're the esteemed Guard General.

12:40.660 --> 12:41.740
But have you ever asked

12:41.740 --> 12:43.500
if I wish to be a general's daughter?

12:44.260 --> 12:45.180
Since childhood,

12:46.060 --> 12:47.820
other girls have had parents around.

12:47.900 --> 12:48.780
What about me?

12:49.060 --> 12:50.580
I've always been neglected.

12:51.580 --> 12:53.020
Have I ever cried

12:53.020 --> 12:53.900
or complained to you?

12:54.140 --> 12:55.140
I've never dared

12:55.140 --> 12:56.420
to ask you for a little concern.

12:56.420 --> 12:57.540
Because you've always been busy.

12:58.060 --> 12:58.820
You're busy

12:58.820 --> 12:59.980
protecting frontier people.

13:00.540 --> 13:02.460
You're busy forging your fame.

13:02.860 --> 13:03.660
You're too busy

13:04.260 --> 13:05.420
to ask your daughter

13:05.460 --> 13:07.300
what she really wants!

13:10.100 --> 13:10.580
Father,

13:11.020 --> 13:12.540
Xun and I love each other.

13:12.860 --> 13:14.100
What's wrong with his origin?

13:14.900 --> 13:16.340
If I can't marry him,

13:16.420 --> 13:17.860
why did you marry my mother,

13:17.860 --> 13:18.700
a noble young lady

13:18.700 --> 13:19.380
from far away?

13:19.500 --> 13:20.660
She stayed with you

13:20.660 --> 13:21.500
and wasted her life here.

13:21.900 --> 13:22.620
Your mother...

13:23.100 --> 13:24.300
You have no right to judge.

13:24.500 --> 13:25.700
Then don't interfere with mine!

13:28.540 --> 13:29.340
Sorry.

13:30.380 --> 13:32.060
I'm sorry, Father.

13:33.260 --> 13:33.940
Father.

13:35.060 --> 13:36.460
I'm sorry!

14:06.660 --> 14:07.300
Father,

14:10.100 --> 14:11.420
I'm finally back.

14:11.580 --> 14:12.220
Good.

14:14.980 --> 14:16.260
Good you're back.

14:38.620 --> 14:39.780
When did this happen?

14:40.260 --> 14:41.380
How did your eyes...?

14:44.300 --> 14:45.180
What did the Army Physician say?

14:47.700 --> 14:49.380
We can send for an Imperial Physician.

14:49.700 --> 14:50.580
You'll be cured.

14:51.220 --> 14:52.500
Don't bother.

14:53.380 --> 14:55.620
With or without my eyesight,

14:56.380 --> 14:57.700
I can see everything

14:57.700 --> 14:59.020
in the camp.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.780
It's all in my heart.

15:16.300 --> 15:17.100
Actually,

15:19.820 --> 15:21.860
after I lost my sight,

15:23.500 --> 15:24.540
I finally managed

15:26.140 --> 15:27.740
to find inner peace.

15:29.300 --> 15:30.500
I feel I am getting old.

15:32.940 --> 15:34.660
I often thought of the past.

15:37.500 --> 15:39.460
The more I thought, the more I felt sorry for you.

15:40.500 --> 15:41.780
You've grown up,

15:43.900 --> 15:45.460
and I've never flown kites

15:45.460 --> 15:46.540
with you.

15:48.140 --> 15:49.620
I even missed

15:52.260 --> 15:53.460
your coming-of-age ceremony.

15:55.380 --> 15:56.780
I still remember those words you said

15:58.300 --> 15:59.580
when you left here.

16:00.780 --> 16:02.300
In the dead of night,

16:04.700 --> 16:06.820
it has haunted me all this time.

16:09.420 --> 16:10.460
You were right.

16:11.420 --> 16:13.260
I've never been a good father.

16:16.380 --> 16:18.140
I've never asked

16:20.460 --> 16:22.220
what you really want.

16:23.460 --> 16:24.580
I have no right

16:27.260 --> 16:28.940
to beg for your forgiveness.

16:31.820 --> 16:32.940
Don't say that, Father.

16:33.660 --> 16:34.980
I'm sorry for what I did to you.

16:36.620 --> 16:37.260
Father,

16:38.420 --> 16:39.660
I shouldn't have said

16:39.660 --> 16:40.620
those harsh words.

16:42.220 --> 16:43.380
Five years ago, I shouldn't

16:43.380 --> 16:44.460
have left willfully

16:44.780 --> 16:46.340
without even leaving you a message.

16:48.700 --> 16:49.340
Father,

16:51.900 --> 16:53.100
will you forgive me?

16:55.860 --> 16:57.780
I've never blamed you.

16:58.700 --> 17:00.140
There's nothing to forgive.

17:01.220 --> 17:03.140
When you're no longer so stubborn,

17:03.580 --> 17:05.300
it feels strange to me.

17:06.540 --> 17:07.660
The biggest pride

17:09.060 --> 17:10.700
of my life

17:12.300 --> 17:13.940
isn't defeating enemies,

17:16.500 --> 17:17.780
but having a daughter

17:20.980 --> 17:23.380
even more stubborn than I am.

17:28.940 --> 17:30.300
On the day of Wangcheng victory,

17:31.340 --> 17:32.900
joy overwhelmed me.

17:34.740 --> 17:35.780
I asked Changrong to write

17:38.420 --> 17:40.020
a congratulatory poem on my behalf.

17:49.100 --> 17:50.740
"My precious daughter was too confined

17:51.380 --> 17:53.220
to let her talents shine.

17:54.660 --> 17:56.580
How could I not think of her?

17:57.140 --> 17:58.900
Yet she chose to temper herself.

17:59.580 --> 18:01.420
She left home and achieved great deeds.

18:02.180 --> 18:03.780
And her talents finally shone brightly.

18:04.140 --> 18:05.860
Glorious and bright,

18:06.340 --> 18:08.460
her light reaches the whole land."

18:09.460 --> 18:10.060
Your Majesty,

18:10.620 --> 18:12.500
an urgent military report about rewards

18:12.980 --> 18:14.380
came from Wangcheng.

18:14.780 --> 18:16.180
Without His Majesty's approval,

18:16.540 --> 18:18.500
Her Highness distributed rewards on her own.

18:18.900 --> 18:21.140
Wasn't she overstepping her authority?

18:26.980 --> 18:28.220
Mr. Xie is on sick leave.

18:29.460 --> 18:30.540
Mr. Deng has a day off, too.

18:31.260 --> 18:32.060
To whom shall we

18:32.900 --> 18:34.140
send this military report?

18:34.820 --> 18:36.860
Mr. Deng, of course.

18:37.620 --> 18:39.460
The late Emperor made him the regent.

18:40.220 --> 18:42.300
We can't bypass him in military affairs.

18:42.580 --> 18:44.020
Military affairs are urgent.

18:44.100 --> 18:45.980
Mr. Deng knows nothing about warfare tactics.

18:46.380 --> 18:48.020
Before Mr. Xie asked for sick leave,

18:48.140 --> 18:49.220
he ordered that all military reports

18:49.460 --> 18:51.020
to be sent to him.

18:52.020 --> 18:54.220
Mr. Deng also gave an order.

18:54.780 --> 18:57.660
Frontier affairs must be reviewed by him.

18:58.140 --> 19:00.940
The Xie Clan of Gaoyang has stood for a century.

19:01.340 --> 19:03.180
Oh. My memory fails me.

19:03.700 --> 19:04.700
How many prime ministers

19:05.220 --> 19:07.220
have come from their clan?

19:09.820 --> 19:11.260
Since the founding of our dynasty,

19:11.900 --> 19:13.020
there have been six.

19:16.860 --> 19:18.140
Then send it to Mr. Xie.

19:21.100 --> 19:21.460
But...

19:21.540 --> 19:23.060
This is ridiculous.

19:24.860 --> 19:25.580
Anything else?

19:26.340 --> 19:27.780
Then the court is dismissed.

19:28.260 --> 19:30.900
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty. - We bid farewell to Your Majesty.

19:32.770 --> 19:34.500
[Xie Residence]

19:37.140 --> 19:38.140
Mr. Xie, have you heard?

19:38.460 --> 19:39.340
In today's court,

19:39.340 --> 19:40.860
we won decisively.

19:41.300 --> 19:42.660
I heard that old censor

19:42.980 --> 19:44.300
nearly fainted from anger.

19:45.540 --> 19:46.940
How many times have I warned you?

19:48.060 --> 19:49.860
You must not be so arrogant.

19:50.540 --> 19:51.220
Arrogance

19:51.660 --> 19:52.700
leads to misfortune.

19:52.980 --> 19:54.220
When people praise you

19:54.340 --> 19:55.180
and our Xie household,

19:55.540 --> 19:56.860
it's hard for me to stay humble.

19:57.460 --> 19:58.540
I can't help feeling proud.

20:00.420 --> 20:01.020
Forget it.

20:02.540 --> 20:03.020
Mr. Xie,

20:03.500 --> 20:04.820
won't you review the report?

20:05.940 --> 20:07.540
Send this report to Mr. Deng.

20:08.380 --> 20:09.780
To him?

20:10.540 --> 20:11.580
Won't you review it?

20:13.820 --> 20:14.740
No one but Mr. Deng

20:15.580 --> 20:16.780
can review this report.

20:17.460 --> 20:18.740
What if he doesn't...?

20:21.740 --> 20:22.580
He will.

20:46.940 --> 20:47.540
Mr. Deng,

20:50.620 --> 20:51.540
you lost.

20:54.900 --> 20:55.780
Don't be angry.

20:56.460 --> 20:57.980
You need patience when dealing

20:58.900 --> 20:59.500
with Xie Yanfang.

21:00.020 --> 21:01.140
He got the military report,

21:01.940 --> 21:03.220
but didn't even bother to review it.

21:04.300 --> 21:05.980
He's obviously humiliating me.

21:16.940 --> 21:17.900
This man...

21:32.940 --> 21:33.740
It's him.

21:34.980 --> 21:35.580
Who?

21:35.980 --> 21:36.660
Liang Qiang.

21:37.420 --> 21:39.180
The Third Prince's case involves his family.

21:39.460 --> 21:41.020
Xie Yanfang had him exiled.

21:44.220 --> 21:45.580
Very good.

21:51.420 --> 21:54.860
[Approved]

21:55.820 --> 21:56.740
Approving it already?

21:59.580 --> 22:01.380
Since he's Xie Yanfang's enemy,

22:02.740 --> 22:04.540
I'll give him some support.

22:17.980 --> 22:18.500
Father.

22:19.420 --> 22:20.380
Father, are you asleep?

22:20.660 --> 22:21.340
I'm back.

22:22.620 --> 22:23.900
I got it. I'm still awake.

22:24.460 --> 22:25.420
I was waiting for you.

22:32.740 --> 22:33.140
Father,

22:33.780 --> 22:34.460
guess

22:34.860 --> 22:35.900
what I brought back.

22:39.300 --> 22:40.820
Did my patrol lady

22:42.460 --> 22:43.820
bring back a spy?

22:49.660 --> 22:51.060
I brought back a rabbit.

22:52.060 --> 22:53.260
Well done, Zhao.

22:54.340 --> 22:59.340
Jiu didn't catch it for you, did he?

23:01.140 --> 23:02.020
No.

23:02.900 --> 23:03.500
Father.

23:04.420 --> 23:04.860
Look.

23:05.740 --> 23:06.980
This little rabbit

23:07.140 --> 23:08.260
looks like a snowball.

23:09.620 --> 23:10.860
Rabbits can bite.

23:11.980 --> 23:13.020
Don't forget.

23:13.740 --> 23:15.300
You got bitten when you were little

23:15.900 --> 23:16.940
and cried for three days.

23:19.500 --> 23:20.140
I did?

23:22.860 --> 23:24.300
I don't remember at all.

23:25.340 --> 23:26.380
You remember almost nothing

23:28.820 --> 23:29.980
about your childhood.

23:37.660 --> 23:38.860
In your childhood,

23:40.340 --> 23:41.460
you were extraordinary.

23:42.340 --> 23:43.660
When you were born,

23:45.140 --> 23:46.500
the room was bathed in red light.

23:47.700 --> 23:49.540
A fortune teller passed by

23:50.780 --> 23:52.740
and was utterly shocked.

23:53.540 --> 23:54.460
He pointed at you and said,

23:55.860 --> 23:57.180
"She's blessed by heaven."

24:00.100 --> 24:00.740
Really?

24:01.140 --> 24:02.580
Did you

24:03.420 --> 24:04.300
go out again

24:04.380 --> 24:05.740
and hear a story at the tea house?

24:06.660 --> 24:09.180
What happened next in the story?

24:09.780 --> 24:10.580
Later,

24:11.740 --> 24:13.660
at this girl's first birthday,

24:15.380 --> 24:18.300
she grabbed the Frontier Tally.

24:20.340 --> 24:21.860
When she was five,

24:23.380 --> 24:26.540
she led the servants and maids

24:27.420 --> 24:29.700
to use brooms as spears

24:31.820 --> 24:33.620
and pot lids as shields,

24:34.940 --> 24:38.700
and she has piled up an enemy city

24:40.980 --> 24:42.260
with bamboo steamers.

24:43.300 --> 24:44.220
She even learned

24:45.220 --> 24:46.780
to deploy troops.

24:47.500 --> 24:49.300
In the end, she captured

24:50.700 --> 24:53.220
the steward's three hens

24:53.220 --> 24:54.260
that would still lay eggs.

24:59.460 --> 25:00.580
I don't remember that.

25:01.180 --> 25:02.260
Was I that remarkable?

25:03.660 --> 25:05.140
Yes, you were.

25:06.100 --> 25:07.020
And the old steward

25:08.500 --> 25:10.260
cried for two nights.

25:20.940 --> 25:21.380
Father,

25:21.380 --> 25:23.300
I love the congratulatory poem

25:25.340 --> 25:26.460
you wrote for me.

25:28.860 --> 25:30.380
Let me recite it again.

25:36.900 --> 25:38.300
"My precious daughter was too confined

25:40.580 --> 25:41.940
to let her talents shine.

25:43.540 --> 25:44.940
How could I not think of her?

25:47.500 --> 25:49.020
Yet she chose to temper herself.

25:50.340 --> 25:52.020
She left home and achieved great deeds.

25:53.860 --> 25:55.340
And her talents finally shone brightly.

25:58.060 --> 25:59.620
Glorious and bright,

26:01.460 --> 26:03.100
her light reaches the whole land."

26:05.420 --> 26:06.980
Father.

26:07.300 --> 26:07.860
Father!

26:09.980 --> 26:10.500
Father!

26:11.300 --> 26:12.820
Army Physician!

26:14.500 --> 26:15.140
Father.

26:30.940 --> 26:32.380
When I left five years ago,

26:33.780 --> 26:35.380
Father could still draw bows and shoot.

26:37.700 --> 26:39.260
When did he fall ill?

26:41.580 --> 26:42.740
Let me be honest.

26:43.660 --> 26:45.140
Over the past two years,

26:45.580 --> 26:46.660
the General has been growing weaker.

26:53.020 --> 26:53.940
Actually,

26:54.540 --> 26:56.140
whether he did or didn't disarm,

26:57.220 --> 26:58.220
he'd end up the same.

26:59.500 --> 27:01.340
He's been poisoned for three years.

27:02.300 --> 27:04.180
You sent him those cakes yourself.

27:04.820 --> 27:07.300
From the Capital to Yunzhong,

27:08.060 --> 27:09.100
they were delivered monthly.

27:09.900 --> 27:11.380
Chu Ling would be killed anyway.

27:12.340 --> 27:13.900
Not only by my blade,

27:15.180 --> 27:16.660
but also by his daughter's love.

27:17.140 --> 27:17.980
This is impossible.

27:18.900 --> 27:19.660
In my past life,

27:20.340 --> 27:21.300
poisoned jujube cakes

27:21.780 --> 27:22.660
were sent to my father

27:22.660 --> 27:23.660
after my wedding.

27:24.620 --> 27:26.100
But in this life, no cakes were sent.

27:26.900 --> 27:28.380
Why is Father still ill?

27:30.500 --> 27:31.700
Do you know

27:32.140 --> 27:33.340
what happened to my father?

27:34.500 --> 27:36.140
I'm not sure about the reason.

27:37.580 --> 27:38.700
I'll make him some medicine

27:39.060 --> 27:40.780
for refreshment and replenishment.

27:46.980 --> 27:48.140
You served him for five years.

27:48.580 --> 27:49.300
Do you know

27:49.300 --> 27:50.780
why he's fading so quickly?

27:53.380 --> 27:53.980
Sorry.

27:55.980 --> 27:56.620
I have no idea.

28:11.900 --> 28:13.100
In this new life,

28:16.460 --> 28:17.820
nothing has changed.

28:20.300 --> 28:21.060
For you,

28:21.820 --> 28:22.500
something has.

28:32.460 --> 28:33.780
Yet some regrets

28:34.580 --> 28:35.500
are inevitable.

28:44.260 --> 28:45.900
Everything has its destiny.

28:49.100 --> 28:50.020
So does a human.

28:52.260 --> 28:53.780
He's defended the frontier all his life

28:55.420 --> 28:56.540
and people revere him.

28:57.860 --> 28:59.060
In the final days of his life,

29:02.460 --> 29:03.540
his daughter and brothers-in-arms

29:05.500 --> 29:06.460
keep him company.

29:08.300 --> 29:09.020
Perhaps,

29:10.580 --> 29:11.940
he isn't in that much pain.

29:15.660 --> 29:17.700
Even if he passes away,

29:21.100 --> 29:22.260
his love for you

29:24.780 --> 29:26.060
won't fade away.

29:27.100 --> 29:28.380
But he shouldn't be like this.

29:29.900 --> 29:31.060
He just shouldn't.

29:32.140 --> 29:33.580
He kills enemies at the frontier

29:34.940 --> 29:36.260
and protects people here.

29:38.980 --> 29:40.180
He has done everything

29:40.180 --> 29:41.220
a general should do.

29:43.020 --> 29:44.340
He protects 200,000 soldiers

29:45.500 --> 29:47.540
and secures the peace of the state.

29:53.940 --> 29:55.020
What else do you want?

29:55.300 --> 29:56.380
I want him to live.

29:57.300 --> 29:58.300
I want him to live!

29:58.980 --> 30:00.020
I want him to call me "silly girl",

30:00.660 --> 30:02.060
make jujube cakes with me,

30:02.060 --> 30:03.420
and teach me riding and archery!

30:04.940 --> 30:06.020
I want to make it up

30:06.940 --> 30:08.420
and do what a daughter should do.

30:10.900 --> 30:12.020
I want him to wait for me

30:12.020 --> 30:13.540
to come home even if he scolds me.

30:15.140 --> 30:16.780
I don't want a cold memorial tablet

30:16.780 --> 30:18.460
of the Guard General.

30:40.980 --> 30:42.100
What's wrong, Aunt?

30:43.980 --> 30:44.660
Chu Ling.

30:45.270 --> 30:47.220
[Chu Ling is dying. No cure. Awaiting your reply.]

30:48.100 --> 30:49.220
He's dying.

30:53.860 --> 30:54.420
Aunt,

30:55.100 --> 30:55.540
you...

30:56.980 --> 30:58.020
Are you going to see him?

31:40.700 --> 31:41.220
Jiu.

31:43.940 --> 31:44.580
Tell me.

31:45.980 --> 31:47.100
What will a man think

31:48.860 --> 31:49.740
before he dies?

31:57.380 --> 31:58.340
Words left unsaid,

32:00.620 --> 32:01.540
promises left unfulfilled...

32:04.060 --> 32:04.740
Or...

32:06.340 --> 32:07.380
Wishes that went unmet.

32:09.380 --> 32:10.580
What could be

32:12.860 --> 32:13.660
my father's wish?

32:16.060 --> 32:17.180
If you really want to know,

32:18.180 --> 32:19.260
you can ask him

32:20.420 --> 32:21.340
when he wakes up.

32:23.140 --> 32:23.820
Just stop

32:23.820 --> 32:24.580
torturing yourself.

32:31.540 --> 32:31.980
Zhao,

32:35.860 --> 32:36.540
you look like

32:36.540 --> 32:37.780
you did something wrong.

32:39.380 --> 32:40.700
Your father wouldn't like it.

32:42.980 --> 32:44.620
I just want to figure it out.

32:47.900 --> 32:49.340
What exactly went wrong

32:50.660 --> 32:51.700
that made me end up

32:51.700 --> 32:52.460
like this again?

32:54.460 --> 32:55.060
I have tried

32:55.060 --> 32:56.100
so hard.

32:56.780 --> 32:58.300
I have tried everything.

32:58.300 --> 32:59.020
Why will my father

32:59.020 --> 33:00.140
still leave me?

33:03.860 --> 33:04.420
Zhao,

33:05.700 --> 33:06.380
calm down.

33:06.820 --> 33:07.980
What else can I do?

33:08.500 --> 33:09.180
Tell me.

33:09.860 --> 33:10.820
What else can I do

33:10.820 --> 33:12.100
to save my father?

33:51.740 --> 33:53.020
It still tastes a bit bland.

33:56.660 --> 33:58.100
He can't take Zhuyu Powder.

33:58.380 --> 33:59.820
He's too weak to take it now.

34:02.940 --> 34:03.700
Madam Ge?

34:04.220 --> 34:04.580
You...

34:05.940 --> 34:07.220
Why are you here?

34:09.420 --> 34:10.580
I'm your father's...

34:15.220 --> 34:15.780
old friend.

34:17.580 --> 34:18.820
I'm here for his final farewell.

34:26.260 --> 34:27.140
Who on earth are you?

35:05.340 --> 35:05.980
Old friend?

35:07.900 --> 35:09.140
What kind of friend

35:10.100 --> 35:11.420
would even remember

35:11.460 --> 35:12.140
his food taboos?

35:16.900 --> 35:18.500
She didn't fight like ordinary bandits.

35:19.940 --> 35:20.900
In the Wangcheng battle,

35:22.020 --> 35:23.380
the way she wielded twin blades

35:25.180 --> 35:25.780
was peculiar.

35:29.700 --> 35:31.420
Mu Mianhong, head of Cangmu Stronghold,

35:32.300 --> 35:33.380
mastered twin scimitars.

35:33.900 --> 35:34.740
In the first year of Tianshu

35:34.900 --> 35:36.260
when Father suppressed them,

35:37.220 --> 35:38.100
she jumped off a cliff and died.

35:40.540 --> 35:41.900
Could she be...?

35:46.340 --> 35:47.260
Mu Mianhong.

36:00.460 --> 36:00.940
General,

36:01.700 --> 36:03.780
this is our new maidservant.

36:04.020 --> 36:04.780
She can't speak,

36:05.500 --> 36:08.700
but she's good at decoction and soup.

36:10.780 --> 36:11.580
Thanks for your work.

36:58.780 --> 36:59.580
Thank you.

37:58.100 --> 38:01.950
[Mu Mianhong]

38:03.900 --> 38:05.300
Do you like this kind of father?

38:06.580 --> 38:07.220
No?

38:09.220 --> 38:09.740
Why?

38:10.380 --> 38:11.940
Because he's a hero to others.

38:12.980 --> 38:14.660
He's a hero to people in Yunzhong.

38:15.460 --> 38:16.420
But I want him

38:16.980 --> 38:18.420
to be an ordinary father.

38:19.620 --> 38:21.060
He would carve wooden dolls for me,

38:21.660 --> 38:22.900
watch fireworks with me,

38:24.020 --> 38:25.780
give me pretty braids,

38:27.700 --> 38:29.100
and be there with me

38:29.500 --> 38:31.180
for every important moment.

38:32.460 --> 38:33.220
But actually...

38:34.140 --> 38:35.020
None of this happened.

38:37.020 --> 38:37.500
What about...

38:40.580 --> 38:41.300
Your mother?

38:45.900 --> 38:46.620
Could Father

38:46.620 --> 38:47.860
have been lying all along?

38:49.580 --> 38:50.460
My mother is...

38:52.940 --> 38:53.700
It can't be.

39:12.060 --> 39:12.740
Zhao.

39:15.940 --> 39:16.860
Zhao.

39:55.380 --> 39:59.980
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

40:00.260 --> 40:02.740
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

40:02.780 --> 40:06.820
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

40:09.060 --> 40:11.180
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

40:11.260 --> 40:13.220
♪And roars in the blaze♪

40:13.300 --> 40:16.540
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

40:16.700 --> 40:18.940
♪Fate imprisons me♪

40:19.100 --> 40:23.900
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

40:23.900 --> 40:28.100
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

40:28.100 --> 40:32.380
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

40:32.380 --> 40:37.820
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

40:37.820 --> 40:39.780
♪With no fear of the distance♪

40:39.780 --> 40:43.500
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

40:43.500 --> 40:47.940
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

40:47.940 --> 40:53.300
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

40:53.300 --> 40:56.900
♪My new pride♪

41:11.700 --> 41:14.580
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

41:14.580 --> 41:17.100
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

41:17.100 --> 41:19.460
♪Amidst the chaos♪

41:19.460 --> 41:23.740
♪I'll always be with you♪

41:25.180 --> 41:27.300
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

41:27.380 --> 41:29.340
♪And roars in the blaze♪

41:29.420 --> 41:32.660
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

41:32.820 --> 41:35.060
♪Fate imprisons me♪

41:35.220 --> 41:40.020
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

41:40.020 --> 41:44.220
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

41:44.220 --> 41:48.500
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

41:48.500 --> 41:53.940
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

41:53.940 --> 41:55.900
♪With no fear of the distance♪

41:55.900 --> 41:59.620
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

41:59.620 --> 42:04.060
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

42:04.060 --> 42:09.420
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

42:09.420 --> 42:13.020
♪My new pride♪
